# The vendored AutoGrid executable and its GCC runtime libraries are binaries.
# Git's autocrlf would otherwise be free to rewrite bytes in them on checkout,
# which corrupts the binary and breaks docking in a way that looks like a
# mysterious runtime crash.
src/bin/** binary
*.so binary
*.so.* binary
*.pkl binary
*.h5 binary
*.npz binary
*.pdbqt text eol=lf
